1958
00:54:13,840 --> 00:54:15,160
Hullult kihutav tüüp.

1959
00:54:15,720 --> 00:54:16,960
Hullumeel.

1960
00:54:17,800 --> 00:54:19,040
Hullumeel!

1961
00:54:19,600 --> 00:54:21,000
Idioot.

1962
00:54:21,040 --> 00:54:22,400
Hullumeel.

1963
00:54:22,440 --> 00:54:25,520
Hullumees! Hetkeks, ma arvan, et...

1964
00:54:22,440 --> 00:54:25,520
Siin on võimalus.

1965
00:54:27,840 --> 00:54:29,440
Oi!

1966
00:54:29,480 --> 00:54:31,000
Saast!

1967
00:54:31,040 --> 00:54:32,960
(KUULUTAJAGA RAADIOS):

1968
00:54:31,040 --> 00:54:32,960
Sa said ju selle "Johnny Foreigner"i koha.

1969
00:54:31,040 --> 00:54:32,960
siin kohale tulemas.

1970
00:54:33,000 --> 00:54:35,080
