1971
00:54:39,520 --> 00:54:42,200
Saastunud kohaliku omavalduse ametnikud!

1972
00:54:39,520 --> 00:54:42,200
ja nende imelikud teed.

1973
00:54:47,120 --> 00:54:49,360
(RAADIOSSE):

1974
00:54:47,120 --> 00:54:49,360
James, seal on kurv.

1975
00:54:47,120 --> 00:54:49,360
Üks kurvi tuleb peagi ette. Kurv.

1976
00:54:49,400 --> 00:54:52,720
Seal on silt, mis ütleb.

1977
00:54:49,400 --> 00:54:52,720
"Kurv on ees. Olge ettevaatlikud."

1978
00:54:49,400 --> 00:54:52,720
sel korral, okei?

1979
00:54:54,480 --> 00:54:57,000
(rehvid hõikavad).

1980
00:54:57,040 --> 00:55:00,200
Ausalt öeldes,

1981
00:54:57,040 --> 00:55:00,200
Ma ei märganud.

1982
00:54:57,040 --> 00:55:00,200
Jaamessi uus õnnetus.

1983
00:55:00,240 --> 00:55:04,520
kuna ma olin selle juba märganud.

1984
00:55:00,240 --> 00:55:04,520
